# Vercel Web Analytics Implementation Report

## Summary
Vercel Web Analytics was **already implemented** in this Next.js project. The implementation follows best practices and is correctly configured.

## Current Implementation Status

### 1. Package Installation ✅
- **Package**: `@vercel/analytics@1.6.1`
- **Status**: Already installed in `package.json`
- **Location**: Listed in dependencies

### 2. Analytics Component Integration ✅
- **File**: `src/app/layout.tsx` (App Router)
- **Import**: `import { Analytics } from "@vercel/analytics/next";`
- **Placement**: Correctly placed inside the `<body>` tag, after the main content
- **Implementation**: `<Analytics />` component added at the end of the body

### 3. Implementation Details

The Analytics component is properly integrated in the root layout:

```typescript
export default function RootLayout({
  children,
}: Readonly<{ children: React.ReactNode }>) {
  return (
    <html lang="es" suppressHydrationWarning>
      <head>...</head>
      <body className={`${inter.variable} font-sans antialiased`}>
        <ThemeProvider>
          {children}
          <MobileNav />
        </ThemeProvider>
        <Analytics />  {/* ✅ Correctly placed */}
      </body>
    </html>
  );
}
```

